7. AI and Machine Learning

   (a) Using the Original Work to train, fine-tune, or evaluate an AI or
       machine learning model, or putting it into a dataset or retrieval
       system for one, uses the entire Original Work. You may do this only
       for non-commercial purposes, unless you have Written Permission.
   (b) Any output from an AI tool that copies or is substantially similar
       to the Original Work counts toward the Used Portion, just as if you
       had copied it yourself.

8. Rewrites and Content

   Rewriting, "clean room" re-creation, or paraphrasing does not avoid this
