10. Ending This License

   (a) If you break any term of this license, all of your permissions end
       automatically and immediately. You must then stop using and sharing
       every Covered Work.
   (b) Fixing a credit mistake: if your only violation was of Section 5,
       and you fix it within 30 days after you learn about it, your
       permissions come back. This can happen only once.
   (c) For any other violation, your permissions come back only if the
       Licensor gives you Written Permission saying so.
   (d) Ending or getting back permission does not cancel what you owe for
       past violations. The Licensor may use every remedy the law allows,
       including court orders to stop you, damages, and your profits from
       the unauthorized use.

